The staleness audit's C-class half. Where the A+B+D pass (#414) deleted
false claims, this one supplies missing ones — silent omissions, which
need new prose rather than a deletion.

Largest:
- analyze/base.py listed the dataclasses and helpers but not
  TreeSitterAnalyzer — its own title subject, 29% of the file, ~105
  subclasses — so the module read as a utility bag rather than the base
  class every analyzer inherits two-pass orchestration from. Also adds
  the stable-identity layer and the memory-pressure guard.
- hypergumbo_tracker/__init__.py described 6 of 33 modules and read as
  storage-plus-CLI, omitting the TUI, the WebAuthn/duress web server,
  auto-sync, the op journal, the stop hook and embedding dedup.
- verify_claims.py gained extra_catalogs / analysis_scope, the taint
  vocabulary gate, and the three caveat kinds.
- io_boundary.py retitled to what it owns: overlays, mode
  discrimination, opacity, the tagging pass, the versioned map.

Ten analyzers stop under-reporting emitted symbol kinds and edge
families. Several gain the rule that makes their output trustworthy
rather than merely present: Haskell's short-name confidence penalty,
Erlang's multi-clause coalescing, Lua's INV-fahub deliberate
withholding, Racket's synthetic unresolved target.

RESIDUE FROM #414 — its sweep was NOT complete, and I said it was.
The verifying grep there ran through `head`, so the count of 9 files
was an artifact of my own truncated command. 21 further stale mentions
of routes_to / invokes_callback / kind="route" survived across 13
files. Re-verified against the live registries this time:
  - `route` is absent from symbol_kinds.py
  - ZERO producers construct kind="route" (all 12 callers go through
    make_route_symbol, which returns kind="function")
  - every consumer already tests meta.framework_role
So the code was correct throughout; only the comments lied. No dead
branch, no live bug. One comment claimed the route kind "matches
rails.yaml symbol_kind pattern" — rails.yaml matches ^class$, and no
YAML matches on a route kind, so it was wrong twice over.

Docs-only. 20126 passed, 100% coverage on changed files, ratchet clean.

